invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: quic_loop_test
reason: handle_ticket hands on_ticket a ticket with no QUIC version, so
  the caller cannot tell which version the ticket belongs to, and a
  resuming configuration that presents it is refused.
  test/quic_loop_ticket_versions.h requires the version 2 of the
  connection that received the ticket, and the version 1 of another.

--- old
    ticket.quic_version = t->quic_negotiated_version;
--- new
    (void)t->quic_negotiated_version;
